      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_6",
      "quote": "Due to heavy traffic on the World Health Organization (WHO) International Clinical Trials Registry Platform (ICTRP) which aggregates records from 17 country and regional trial registries 4 , on 24 March 2020 this central information source was no longer accessible to anyone outside of the WHO. A download of all COVID-19 trials from the ICTRP database was made available to us on 1 April 2020",
